(text "BATMAN / CHARGE" (at 15 16 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid d223a588-b58b-5fa0-bfb9-cd0fb46308de))
(text "REMOVE relay VCC-JD_VCC jumper. Route VCC / JD_VCC separately from X3.\nDPS: GND TX RX -> G R T; leave V unconnected. Set mDC5 to 5.0 V BEFORE plugging J1.\nNever close K1 and K2 together. Switch relays only at verified zero current. Hardware rating: 10 A maximum." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7a2f651b-7a0e-5c08-ba52-d755be74c567))
